     and full-mouth-dental-implants.css:375-395 are the same rules character for
     character, so the three pages agree on everything except the column count.

     Owned here rather than left to the page sheets for the reason this whole
     phase exists: `.aos4 .config-card` is a DESCENDANT selector off a namespace
     class the block is not inside, so it cannot reach a block-rendered card at
