     one-for-one (bone-grafting.css:6-27). Rendered values unchanged. Owned
     here for the same reason as the alternatives grid above: `.bgraft
     .materials-block` is a descendant selector off a namespace class this
     block is not inside, so it cannot reach a block-rendered row at all —
     without these rules a back-filled glossary renders as an unstyled <dl>.

     `.materials-head .eyebrow` carries only the two layout declarations the
     source rule carries (bone-grafting.css:965-968) — the type itself is the
     shared `.eyebrow` rule above, which restates `.bgraft .eyebrow`
     (bone-grafting.css:32-36) token for token.

     `.materials-head p` states no font-size because the source rule states
